{
  "title": "Attacker Persona & Proxy Health",
  "uid": "capstone-persona",
  "tags": [
    "capstone",
    "persona",
    "health"
  ],
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "PG Backend",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "capstone_pgproxy_backend_healthy"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "MySQL Backend",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 3,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "capstone_mysqlproxy_backend_healthy"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "PG Total Connections",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "capstone_pgproxy_total_connections"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "MySQL Total Connections",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 9,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "capstone_mysqlproxy_total_connections"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "PG Rejected",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "capstone_pgproxy_rejected_connections"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "MySQL Kill Requests",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 15,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "capstone_mysqlproxy_kill_requests"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "PG Dial Errors",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "capstone_pgproxy_backend_dial_errors"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "MySQL Dial Errors",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 21,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "capstone_mysqlproxy_backend_dial_errors"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Connection Rate \u2014 Both Proxies",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(capstone_pgproxy_total_connections[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "PostgreSQL/s"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(capstone_mysqlproxy_total_connections[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "MySQL/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Active Sessions Over Time",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "capstone_pgproxy_active_connections",
          "legendFormat": "PG active"
        },
        {
          "expr": "capstone_mysqlproxy_active_connections",
          "legendFormat": "MySQL active"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Aggregate Scaling Score and Target",
      "description": "Per-session series retired. Detailed session investigations use Evidence Store or Loki.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "capstone_scaling_scorer_mean",
          "legendFormat": "global score mean"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "capstone_scaling_current_replicas",
          "legendFormat": "desired replica target"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Trap Table Encounters",
      "description": "Each spike = attacker accessed a honeytoken table",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "capstone_mitre_trap_triggers_total",
          "legendFormat": "cumulative trap triggers"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "lineWidth": 2
          },
          "color": {
            "fixedColor": "red",
            "mode": "fixed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Scale Formula Reference",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Scaling Formula\n\n```\nscale_score = 0.4 \u00d7 attacker_confidence\n            + 0.3 \u00d7 session_depth\n            + 0.2 \u00d7 query_entropy\n            + 0.1 \u00d7 failed_auth_ratio\n```\n\n**EWMA \u03b1 = 0.3** \u00b7 prevents sudden spike-driven scaling &nbsp;&nbsp; | &nbsp;&nbsp; **Z-score threshold = 2.5** \u00b7 bot-flood suppression &nbsp;&nbsp; | &nbsp;&nbsp; **Scale-up threshold = 0.6** \u00b7 **Scale-down threshold = 0.3** (hysteresis = 2 min)"
      }
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 36
}
